     "href": "https://www.hok.no/en/exhibitions/kai-fjell-2"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": {
      "content": ", a retrospective of one of Norway's most-loved painters (1907 to 1989), on from 2 May to 1 November 2026. Fjell doesn't get a room this size very often. Expect dreamlike, folk-tinged scenes, women and landscapes and interiors, in colour laid on thick and warm. It is the kind of painting that rewards a slow lap.",
